 (1516–1517)</span><span class="enc-type">War · 1517</span><span class="enc-snip">The Ottoman–Mamluk War was a conflict between the Ottoman Empire and the Mamluk Sultanate in 1516–1517.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-persian-wars"><span class="enc-name">Ottoman–Persian Wars</span><span class="enc-type">War · 1514–1823</span><span class="enc-snip">The Ottoman–Persian Wars were the conflicts between the Ottoman Empire and the successive dynasties of Iran, from the Safavids to the Qajars, between 1514 and 1823.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-safavid-war-1532-1555"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ottoman-safavid-war-1532-1555.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Ottoman–Safavid War (1532–1555)</span><span class="enc-type">War · 1532–1555</span><span class="enc-snip">The Ottoman–Safavid War of 1532–1555 was fought between the Ottoman Empire of Suleiman the Magnificent and Safavid Persia under Tahmasp I.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-safavid-war-1623-1639"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ottoman-safavid-war-1623-1639.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Ottoman–Safavid War (1623–1639)</span><span class="enc-type">War · 1623–1639</span><span class="enc-snip">The Ottoman–Safavid War of 1623–1639 was the last major war between the Ottoman Empire and Safavid Iran.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-safavid-wars"><span class="enc-name">Ottoman–Safavid wars</span><span class="enc-type">War</span><span class="enc-snip">The Ottoman–Safavid wars were a series of conflicts between the Sunni Ottoman Empire and the Shi'a Safavid Empire from the sixteenth to the eighteenth century.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-venetian-war-1570-1573"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/image